  "title": "packaging: Add dftest and idl2wrs to -devel RPM",
  "description": "dftest is useful for development, add it to the \"Development\" component\n(which is excluded from default targets).\n\nidl2wrs is only used for development, so put it in the -devel package.\nMove it to the \"Development\" component as well. (We still should rename\none of the two \"idl2wrs\" - there's the DCERPC one and the CORBA one.)\n\nThis doesn't affect packaging for other systems - it probably should\nbe shipped as part of a development package for Windows (#19976) or\nmacOS (#19010).\n\nPing #1199, #19976",
